 the agents about their mission. It offers: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Information about the time and the place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mission updates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hints about the objects you\u2019re looking for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Translation services. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Comments that no one asked for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come help Jaxon on his adventure. I mean, look at how cute he is:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718770/extras/Cutest-Jaxon.png?t=1749832029\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ubik Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2777680","name":"Untimely Hidden: Patara"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718770/7361bfffcb656fc8c062e5dc9ccfd8b2a407a155/header.jpg?t=1749832029","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154016,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154016/movie480.mp4?t=1749484189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154016/movie_max.mp4?t=1749484189"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154016/c48380f07825ffe86e045cbd69090d97ab5a9569/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749484189","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154016/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749484189","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154016/movie_max_v